hth White Earth Star|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} |Happaku Dosei |Earth |Northeast |{{ill|Gen|ja|艮|1=Gen (Bagua)|lt=Gen|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} | style="background:white;" |White |- !{{ill|Ninth Purple Fire Star|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} |Kyūshi Kasei |Fire |{{ill|South|ja|南|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} |{{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Li (Bagua)|lt=Li|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} | style="background:purple;color:white;" |Purple |}
